OL,5,G0600 AFRODEUTSCHE
OL,6,     FReclaim your Sunday morning with a
OL,7,     Fcurated journey from AFRODEUTSCHE
OL,8,     F- the restorative musical flow you
OL,9,     Fneed to reset your mind and find
OL,10,     Fyour center.
OL,11,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,12,     FMark and Stuart present a feast of
OL,13,     Fgreat music and chat for weekend
OL,14,     Fbreakfast, and they celebrate the
OL,15,     F50th anniversary of Stevie
OL,16,     FWonder's album Songs in the Key of
OL,17,     FLife.
OL,18,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,19,     FGideon Coe chats to musician Nat
OL,20,     FBirchall about the impact of John
OL,21,     FColtrane around what would have
OL,22,     Fbeen his 100th birthday.
