OL,9,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,10,     FJarvis takes listeners with him
OL,11,     Fwhilst he visits the sights and
OL,12,     Fsounds New York City. He hits
OL,13,     FCarnegie Hall, Max's, Radio City
OL,14,     FMusic Hall, the 59th Street Bridge
OL,15,     Fand the docks.
